    "Sufficient evidence has been submitted to demonstrate on a ‘balance of probabilities’ that the use of the ground floor property confirm that the property has been operating under an E Use Class since 20 March 2015; therefore on the basis of the information provided, this application provides convincing evidence to demonstrate the continuous use of the property for Café/restaurant use. The use has been continuously occupied in excess of 10 years and are, therefore, immune from planning enforcement action as set out in s171b of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended)."
